    "text": "   103   Full Auto Trigger System       Passively grants 0.9x Fire Recovery Delay on Shotguns. The perk version of the \"Full Auto Firing\" setting in Gameplay on every other Weapon Type.   +And I guess it grants +5 Stability on   The Last Dance  ,   The Last Perdition  , and   Lonesome  .   ",
    "html": "<tr style=\"height: 89px\"><th id=\"1662574278R102\" style=\"height: 89px;\"><div style=\"line-height: 89px\">103</div></th><td class=\"s14\">Full Auto Trigger System</td><td class=\"s26\"><div style=\"width:70px;height:89px;\"><img src=\"https://docs.google.com/sheets-images-rt/AO43MLY9kpovpq59usuuO1TWECRwLs8j3WsVRv9AZBT393hG1DibTMIrI2rksoFM-DFrj9l63_kVtAiaCeMuG-J3CZbmeclQ9_FxSpkiVdYkPcFATBUGFKq7xQg11FVFzZBPwwmkKdkAJZ0oP-SzsdkUoLNk-zlR1Ep4cpS7=w70-h89\" style=\"width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;\"/></div></td><td class=\"s16\" colspan=\"4\">Passively grants 0.9x Fire Recovery Delay on Shotguns.<br>The perk version of the &quot;Full Auto Firing&quot; setting in Gameplay on every other Weapon Type.<br><br><span style=\"color:#ffd966;\">+And I guess it grants +5 Stability on </span><span style=\"color:#89cdd1;\">The Last Dance</span><span style=\"color:#ffd966;\">, </span><span style=\"color:#bba5f3;\">The Last Perdition</span><span style=\"color:#ffd966;\">, and </span><span style=\"color:#999999;\">Lonesome</span><span style=\"color:#ffd966;\">.</span></td></tr>"
  },
